.Sh CAVEATS
There is no synchronisation between devices; transfer data with backup and
restore.
Data is only as safe as the backups you take, and exported backups contain
personal timetable data in plain text.
Reminder delivery depends on the device permitting alarms, so aggressive
battery optimisation can delay or suppress notifications.
Widget updates depend on the launcher honouring
.Ql RemoteViews
refreshes and on data actually changing or a class boundary passing.
